meta {
  name: Create Payment Other
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/finance/payment-console/payment-other
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "applicationGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "studentGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "ledgerOthersGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "amount": 50000,
    "currencyGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "payDate": "2026-07-30",
    "payType": 1,
    "remarks": "Hostel fee payment",
    "receiptBookGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "procBankGuid": null,
    "paymentAdvanceGuid": null
  }
}

docs {
  Records a payment against a non-tuition ("other") ledger, e.g. hostel fee
  or library fine. `payType`: 1=Cash, 2=Cheque, 3=Bank, 4=DemandDraft,
  5=Online. If `paymentAdvanceGuid` is supplied, the payment is funded from
  an existing advance deposit instead of a new receipt. `studentGuid`,
  `remarks`, `receiptBookGuid`, `procBankGuid`, `paymentAdvanceGuid` are
  optional.

  Success (201): data = PaymentOtherResultDto (paymentOtherGuid, paymentCode,
  receipt, amount).
  Failure: 400 `validation_error` if required fields are missing/invalid.
}
